    "detail": {
      "id": 1320501,
      "name": "[Hoshimi Miyabi] Awakening of the Bees",
      "desc": "Replaces <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack: Fuyubachi</color> with <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack: Fuyubachi — Maximum</color>. Upon activating this skill, Hoshimi Miyabi will <color=#2BAD00>dash forward</color> and deal <color=#98EFF0>Frost DMG</color> to enemies. After the skill is replaced, when Hoshimi Miyabi is knocked back or launched, using Basic Attack or Special Attack while a target is staggered will <color=#2BAD00>immediately trigger</color> <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack: Fuyubachi — Maximum</color>, <color=#2BAD00>restoring 70% of the DMG she just received in HP and granting invulnerability for 0.5s</color>.",
